{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"98eb1d8bb5311e3f","type":"group","x":40,"y":-480,"width":1200,"height":3180,"color":"#ffffff","label":"AIM System (FUNCTIONAL) COPY"},
		{"id":"35dd94b26d9c44e9","type":"group","x":1480,"y":-480,"width":1360,"height":2360,"label":"Pseudocode"},
		{"id":"0ad67e1824c57475","type":"group","x":40,"y":-240,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Options Seed Type"},
		{"id":"8f3ede2cb6df1919","type":"group","x":40,"y":160,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Microstructure Seed Type"},
		{"id":"91f2a45c08b2e65b","type":"group","x":40,"y":560,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Macro / Event Seed Type"},
		{"id":"1a04c3daad7ddd4a","type":"group","x":40,"y":1020,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Cross-Asset Seed Type"},
		{"id":"2826453b2886d82a","type":"group","x":40,"y":1480,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Temporal Seed Type"},
		{"id":"2bfa2959e653e696","type":"group","x":40,"y":1940,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Temporal Seed Type"},
		{"id":"6b5418b19900014e","type":"group","x":40,"y":2380,"width":1140,"height":320,"label":"Opportunity (no HDWN Seed - Session-Level, not per-asset)"},
		{"id":"88ac1eee38dca46c","type":"text","text":"AIM-01: Volatility Risk Premium\n-\nDATA: ATM IV + RV (P2-D01)\nLEARNS: IV/RV → ORB perf\nMOD:\n    vrp_z>1.5→1.15\n    vrp_z>0.5→1.05\n    vrp_z<-1→0.85\nWARM-UP: 120d  TIER: 2\n","x":40,"y":-240,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"042e9a8f9c1bbfee","type":"text","text":"AIM-08: Dynamic Correlation\n-\nDATA: ES,NQ,CL + DXY,10Y,USD/CAD\nARCH: TV-GARCH + DCC + RS Copula\nMOD: \n     corr_z>1.5→0.80 (stress)\n     corr_z>0.5→0.90; <-0.5→1.05\n\nHigh corr→concentrate. Low→spread.\nWARM-UP: 120d  TIER: 1","x":40,"y":1020,"width":570,"height":320},
		{"id":"5f1a158191570a31","type":"text","text":"AIM-02: Options Skew & Positioning\n-\nDATA: 25δ RR, PCR, blocks\nLEARNS: extreme skew → directional accuracy\nMOD:\n     combined>1.5→0.75\n     combined>0.5→0.90\n     combined<-1→1.10\n    \n WARM-UP: 120d  TIER: 3","x":420,"y":-240,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"546583a3b416fb6a","type":"text","text":"AIM-03: Gamma Exposure (GEX)\n-\nDATA: OI by strike:\nLEARNS: dealer γ → range expand\nMOD:\n    gex_z<-1→0.85\n    gex_z>1→1.10\n    expiry day→×0.95\n\nWARM-UP: 250d TIER: 3","x":800,"y":-240,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"9838957aa519d1f5","type":"text","text":"AIM-09: Spatio-Temporal Momentum\n-\nDATA: MACD features across assets\nLEARNS: cross-asset momentum → ORB\nMOD:\n     agree with direction→1.10\n     disagree→0.85\nAll agree → modifier > 1.0\n\nWARM-UP: 60d  TIER: 2\n","x":610,"y":1020,"width":570,"height":320},
		{"id":"1424972818cd6a39","type":"text","text":"AIM-10: Calendar Effect\n-\nDATA: DOW, OPEX, month, rollover\nLEARNS: seasonality per asset\nMOD: \n    opex_window→×0.95\n    high_vol regime→×0.97\nWeak signal — confidence = 0.3\n\nWARM-UP: DOW:120d, Season: 500d TIER: 2","x":40,"y":1480,"width":570,"height":320},
		{"id":"8c1afa35072b0ab1","type":"text","text":"AIM-04: Pre-Market / Overnight\n-\n\nDATA: IVTS (VIX/VXV), Globex vol, gap\nMOD:\n     ivts>1→0.65 (turmoil)\n     ivts≥0.93→1.10 (opt)\n     ivts<0.93→0.80 (quiet)\n     gap_z>2→×0.85\n\nWARM-UP: 60d  TIER: 1","x":40,"y":160,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"8ec7b74f79af12c4","type":"text","text":"AIM-06: Economic Calendar Impact\n-\nDATA: FOMC, NFP, CPI, PMI, EIA schedule\nLEARNS: per-event × per-asset matrix\nMOD:\n     Tier1 near ORB→0.70\n     Tier1 later→1.05; Tier2 near→0.85\n     FOMC→×0.85; EIA+CL→×0.90\n\nWARM-UP: ~2yr (per-event)  TIER: 1","x":40,"y":560,"width":570,"height":320},
		{"id":"63876321e45a86a5","type":"text","text":"AIM-07: COT Positioning\n-\nDATA: Weekly CFTC reports\nLEARNS: extreme positioning → regime\nMOD:\n    SMI>0→1.05; SMI<0→0.90\n    spec_z>1.5→×0.95 (crowded long)\n    spec_z<-1.5→×1.10 (extreme short)\n\nWARM-UP: 52 releases  TIER: 3","x":610,"y":560,"width":570,"height":320},
		{"id":"121cf2ddc880895a","type":"text","text":"AIM-05: Order Book Depth\n-\nDATA: L2 order book\nSTATUS: Returns 1.0\nWARM-UP: 120d  TIER: 3\nRequires L2 infrastructure","x":420,"y":160,"width":380,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3dbee2eca77b3028","type":"text","text":"AIM-15: Volume Quality\n-\nDATA: OR volume vs 20d avg\nMOD: \n     ratio>1.5→1.15\n     ratio>1.0→1.05\n     ratio<0.7→0.80\nWARM-UP: 60d  TIER: 1","x":800,"y":160,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"94f525c67354816e","type":"text","text":"AIM-11: Regime Early Warning\n-\nDATA: VIX term structure, credit spreads\nLEARNS: transitions EARLIER than P2\nMOD: \n    vix_z>1.5→0.75; vix_z>0.5→0.90\n    vix_z<-0.5→1.05\n    vix_spike→×0.85; CL backw→×0.90\nImpending change → pre-emptive reduction\n\n\nWARM-UP: 120d  TIER: 1","x":610,"y":1480,"width":570,"height":320},
		{"id":"1189dc5dc8676516","type":"text","text":"AIM SYSTEM: 16 INDIVIDUAL MODULES BY SEED TYPE\n-\nEach AIM: data source → internal model → modifier ∈ [0.5, 1.5] → DMA/MoE → Kelly","x":-740,"y":-480,"width":679,"height":240},
		{"id":"a745e3e07b33c3d0","type":"text","text":"AIM-12: Dynamic Cost Estimator\n-\nDATA: fill prices, spreads\nLEARNS: condition-specific cost estimate\nMOD: \n     spread_z>1.5→0.85\n     spread_z<-0.5→1.05\n     +systematic ×0.95\n\nWARM-UP: 50 trades TIER: 1","x":40,"y":1940,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"b511c8527e4166c0","type":"text","text":"AIM-13: Sensitivity Scanner\n-\nDATA: Offline B5 scan\nLEARNS: parameter robust.\nMOD: \n     FRAGILE→0.85\n     ROBUST→1.0\n     Monthly scan (±20% grid)\n     PBO, DSR → flag\n\nWARM-UP: none  TIER: 2","x":420,"y":1940,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"6c4e46936ca4253c","type":"text","text":"AIM-14: Auto-Expansion\n-\nDATA: decay events\nNOT a modifier AIM\nReturns 1.0 always\nTriggers P1/P2 re-run on Level 3 decay\n\nOn demand  TIER: 2\n","x":800,"y":1940,"width":380,"height":320},
		{"id":"ce43ac4f57a556ef","type":"text","text":"AIM-16: Opportunity Regime HMM\n-\nDATA: signal count, mean OO, volume z-score, VIX, prior session PnL, cross-corr, DOW\nMODEL: Gaussian HMM, K=3 (LOW_OPP / NORMAL / HIGH_OPP), TVTP, smoothing α=0.3\nTRAIN: Baum-Welch, rolling 60d (240 obs). Supervised init from P&L quartiles.\nINFER: Forward algorithm → session budget weights (normalised state probabilities)\nOUTPUT: per-SESSION weights (not per-asset). Affects capital allocation across sessions\nWARM-UP: 60d (240 observations)  TIER: 1","x":40,"y":2380,"width":1140,"height":320},
		{"id":"a7adb9f6d8957e5c","type":"text","text":"DMA/MoE AGGREGATION (see DMA_MOE_METALEARNING_ASCII.md\n-\nDMA (Offline B1): P(AIM|data) ∝ P^λ × L(x|AIM). λ=0.99. → inclusion probabilities.\nMoE (Online B3): combined_mod = Σ(mod × DMA_weight) / Σ(weights). Clamped [0.5, 1.5].\nHDWM: weekly diversity — 6 seed types, force-reactivate if all suppressed.\nDrift: daily ADWIN — weight *= 0.5 on drift detection.\n→ combined_modifier feeds Kelly Layer 5","x":40,"y":2960,"width":1140,"height":200},
		{"id":"90a6fc527c6ff31d","type":"text","text":"LIFECYCLE: INSTALLED → COLLECTING → WARM_UP → ELIGIBLE → ACTIVE → (SUPPRESSED ↔ ACTIVE)\n-\nMin evaluation: 50 trades before meta-weight adjusts from 1.0.\n\nAuto-recovery from SUPPRESSED: meta_weight > 0.1 for 10+ consecutive trades.","x":40,"y":3280,"width":1140,"height":172},
		{"id":"13a473af588e976e","type":"text","text":"OPTIONS\n-\n```\nPROC aim_01(features, asset):  vrp_z = z_score(vrp, 120d)\n    IF vrp_z>1.5: 1.15  ELIF >0.5: 1.05  ELIF <-1: 0.85  ELSE: 1.0\n    overnight refinement: IF overnight_z>1 AND base>=1: base+=0.05\n    \nPROC aim_02(features, asset):  combined = 0.6*pcr_z + 0.4*skew_z\n    IF >1.5: 0.75  ELIF >0.5: 0.90  ELIF <-1: 1.10  ELSE: 1.0\n\nPROC aim_03(features, asset):  gex_z = z_score(gex, 60d)\n    IF <-1: 0.85  ELIF >1: 1.10  ELSE: 1.0. IF expiry_day: ×0.95. IF triple_witch: ×0.90\n```\n\n","x":1480,"y":-480,"width":1360,"height":320},
		{"id":"7d88f099576e040c","type":"text","text":"MICROSTRUCTURE\n-\n```\nPROC aim_04(features, asset):  ivts = VIX/VXV  -- 5-zone per Paper 67 / DEC-03\n    IF ivts > 1.10        : 0.65 (severe backwardation, conf 0.9)\n    ELIF ivts > 1.00      : 0.80 (backwardation, conf 0.8)\n    ELIF ivts >= 0.93     : 1.10 (optimal — Paper 67 validated, conf 0.9)\n    ELIF ivts >= 0.85     : 0.90 (quiet, conf 0.6)\n    ELSE                  : 0.80 (deep quiet — costs dominate, conf 0.6)\n    Overnight gap overlay: IF overnight_z>2: ×0.85  ELIF overnight_z>1: ×0.95  [Q-23.b PENDING]\n    EIA overlay:          IF asset==CL AND is_eia_wednesday: ×0.90              [Q-23.d PENDING — relocation under review]\n\nPROC aim_05(features, asset):  RETURN 1.0  -- DEFERRED (L2 infrastructure required)\n\nPROC aim_15(features, asset):  vol_ratio = OR_volume / avg_20d\n    IF >1.5: 1.15  ELIF >1.0: 1.05  ELIF <0.7: 0.80  ELSE: 1.0\n```\n\n","x":1480,"y":-80,"width":1360,"height":320},
		{"id":"3d460811bf82fa1e","type":"text","text":"MACRO / EVENT\n-\n```\nPROC aim_06(features, asset):  events = calendar(today, asset)\n    highest_tier = min(event.tier); near_orb = |proximity| <= 30min\n    Tier1+near: 0.70  Tier1+later: 1.05  Tier2+near: 0.85  Tier2: 0.95  else: 1.0\n    IF CL+EIA: ×0.90. IF FOMC: ×0.85\nPROC aim_07(features, asset):  RETURN 1.0  -- DEFERRED per DEC-08 (no CFTC COT data pipeline)\n    -- Reactivation conditions: CFTC COT weekly feed wired; cot_smi + cot_speculator_z\n    -- features available in P3-D01. Original logic preserved in shared/aim_compute.py:_aim07_cot.\n```\n","x":1480,"y":320,"width":1360,"height":320},
		{"id":"09964c5890e2135f","type":"text","text":"CROSS-ASSET\n-\n```\nPROC aim_08(features, asset):  corr_z = z_score(20d_corr, 252d)\n    IF >1.5: 0.80 (stress)  ELIF >0.5: 0.90  ELIF <-0.5: 1.05  ELSE: 1.0\nPROC aim_09(features, asset):  momentum = cross_asset_momentum\n    IF agrees with strategy_direction: 1.10  IF disagrees: 0.85  ELSE: 1.0\n```","x":1480,"y":720,"width":1360,"height":200},
		{"id":"50faefe7ced08dff","type":"text","text":"TEMPORAL\n-\n```\nPROC aim_10(features, asset):  IF opex_window: ×0.95. IF high_vol_regime: ×0.97. conf=0.3\nPROC aim_11(features, asset):  vix_z = z_score(VIX, 252d)\n    IF >1.5: 0.75  ELIF >0.5: 0.90  ELIF <-0.5: 1.05  ELSE: 1.0\n    IF vix_change_z>2: ×0.85. IF CL+backwardation+stress: ×0.90\n```","x":1480,"y":1020,"width":1360,"height":220},
		{"id":"982597abe6892238","type":"text","text":"INTERNAL\n-\n```\nPROC aim_12(features, asset):  spread_z = z_score(spread, 60d)\n    IF spread_z>1.5 OR vol_z>1.5: 0.85  ELIF >0.5: 0.95  ELIF both<-0.5: 1.05  ELSE: 1.0\n    ×0.95 systematic penalty\nPROC aim_13(features, asset):  scan = P3-D13[asset]\n    IF FRAGILE: 0.85  ELSE: 1.0. conf=0.7 if pbo exists else 0.3\nPROC aim_14(features, asset):  RETURN 1.0  -- NOT a modifier. Triggers P1/P2 on L3 decay\n```","x":1480,"y":1320,"width":1360,"height":260},
		{"id":"6aae3a2a681c707e","type":"text","text":"OPPORTUNITY\n-\n```\nAIM-16: HMM (see doc 22 for full Baum-Welch training + forward inference pseudocode)\nK=3 (LOW_OPP, NORMAL, HIGH_OPP). TVTP covariates: VIX, DOW, prior_PnL. smooth α=0.3\nOUTPUT: session budget weights (not per-asset modifier)\n```","x":1480,"y":1680,"width":1360,"height":200},
		{"id":"672929097b27d1fd","type":"text","text":"\nDISPATCH:\n-\n```\ncompute_aim_modifier(aim_id, features, asset) → routes to aim_01..aim_15\n\n  ALL modifiers clamped to [0.5, 1.5]. All return {modifier, confidence, reason_tag, timestamp}\n```\n```","x":1480,"y":1940,"width":1360,"height":180},
		{"id":"8b669bfaa90b0e95","type":"text","text":"DMA/MoE AGGREGATION → combined_modifier → Kelly Layer 5\n-\nPROC dma_update(trade, D02, D05, λ=0.99): FOR aim: L=mag_weighted_likelihood; update\nPROC aggregate(D01, D02, asset): weighted=Σ(mod×p)/Σ(p); clamp [0.5,1.5]\nPROC diversity_check(): FOR type IN 6 seeds: IF all suppressed → reactivate best\nPROC drift_detect(aim): autoencoder + ADWIN → weight *=0.5 on drift\n ","x":1480,"y":2240,"width":1360,"height":180}
	],
	"edges":[
